    "body": "Support for custom command timeouts was only just introduced in 1.6.2, so in 1.5.4 timeouts could not have happened. Have you verified that your custom commands has slowed down? In general, using a different shell for the custom module (`shell = \"sh\"`) or in this case using an [env_var module](https://starship.rs/config/#environment-variable) instead of a custom module should speed this up.",
